<img alt="" class="no-border" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/guide/images/27798.png"/> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47223/ring-of-the-darkmender">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_80.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Darkmender</span></a>
<br/>
<img alt="" class="no-border" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/icons/horde.png"/> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47278/circle-of-the-darkmender">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_80.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Circle of the Darkmender</span></a></td>
<td>30 <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2711/defilers-scourgestone">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Defiler's Scourgestone</span></span></a></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>8</td>
<td>
<img alt="" class="no-border" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/guide/images/27798.png"/> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47089/cloak-of-displacement">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloak of Displacement</span></a>
<br/>
<img alt="" class="no-border" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/icons/horde.png"/> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47291/shroud-of-displacement">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shroud of Displacement</span></a></td>
<td>30 <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2711/defilers-scourgestone">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Defiler's Scourgestone</span></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<br/>
<br/>There are a lot of good BoE options this phase to help people gear up. While most of the raid drop BoEs might be prohibitively expensive, the two crafted items won't really be since you can acquire <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49908/primordial-saronite">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_felflamebreath.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Primordial Saronite</span></a> by doing Defense Protocol Gamma dungeons, making them pretty easy to obtain. In particular, the legs are essentially BiS for the phase, beaten out only slightly by fairly high contest cloth legs that drop from a 25H ICC boss. While the boots aren't as good, they're very very close to BiS as well.<br/>
<br/>As per the ordering of this list, it's highly recommended to go for the ring or neck if they're within your budget as the heroic versions of these items are EXTREMELY highly contested and will generally be out of reach of most healers until the expansion is pretty much over. However, in general you can ignore the 264 raid drops unless you're very flush on cash as they'll likely be very expensive or just not as good as 25H raid drops.<br/>
<br/>Lastly, several items that are equipped on this pre-raid page are BoE on their own - but they're far down in this list as they're not going to be as good as any of the 264 raid items (or even the 251 items from 10 man). However, they'll likely be very affordable, so consider purchasing them with gold to shorten your dungeon grind.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-gems">Best Gems for Holy Paladin Healer - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Meta Socket - <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41401/insightful-earthsiege-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_shadowspirit_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Insightful Earthsiege Diamond</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Red Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40151/luminous-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Luminous Ametrine</span></a> <b>&gt;</b> <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40047/luminous-monarch-topaz">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Luminous Monarch Topaz</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Blue Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40175/dazzling-eye-of-zul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dazzling Eye of Zul</span></a> <b>&gt;</b> <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40094/dazzling-forest-emerald">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dazzling Forest Emerald</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Yellow Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40123/brilliant-kings-amber">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_38.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant King's Amber</span></a> <b>&gt;</b> <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40012/brilliant-autumns-glow">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_26.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Autumn's Glow</span></a></div></li></ul>You will want to use only one of each orange and green gem for the meta gem requirements, in your best possible socket bonuses; in all other cases, you will ignore socket bonuses and gem <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40123/brilliant-kings-amber">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_38.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant King's Amber</span></a> everywhere. You can also alternatively use all yellow gems and a single <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49110/nightmare-tear">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_pearl_12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nightmare Tear</span></a> at a slight stat value loss, particularly if you prefer to go full Haste.<br/>
<br/>For maximum throughput if mana is not an issue, you can consider changing some of the yellow gems to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40128/quick-kings-amber">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_38.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Quick King's Amber</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>With the advent of Phase 3 and the Trial of the Crusader, epic gems were made available. They are strict upgrades from the rare gems with no socketed limitations, unlike Stormjewels. Because they're just strict upgrades, every other aspect of gemming is the same. Their prices are a little higher than rare gems, so consider using rare gems for short-lived items or slots that you'll likely get an immediate upgrade for. You should use epic gems for any of the items immediately on this list that you acquire, unless you know you will get the raid BiS immediately afterwards.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-enchants">Best Enchants for Holy Paladin Healer - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Head - <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50370/arcanum-of-blissful-mending">
