<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Cloak - <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47898/enchant-cloak-greater-speed">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Greater Speed</span></a></div></li>
