<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Feet - <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41118/nitro-boosts">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_rocketbootextreme.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a> (Engineering) &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47901/enchant-boots-tuskarrs-vitality">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Tuskarr's Vitality</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Main-Hand Weapon - <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=27968/enchant-weapon-major-intellect">
